Subject: Admit original main's EnableAllStadiums for the Domination route
Upstream-base: 9046e67aa2077a7eb4ed6e28c9df3c1d3b368f84
Classification: temporary explicit original-source diagnostic admission; depends on 0551.

Every StadiumInfo entry starts with mEnabled false; original main enables all
seventeen with EnableAllStadiums() right after the boot INI wait. The
bootstrap diagnostic omits that whole block, so StadiumSelectScene::
SceneCreated found no enabled-and-unlocked stadium, never assigned
mStadiumIndex, and Update indexed mStadiumOrder with an uninitialized value
(observed 0xBB23DBA0) and crashed. Admit only the EnableAllStadiums call at
its original position under the Domination admission; the configuration,
datetime, build-number and remaining statements keep their omission. Stadium
locks still come from the original IsStadiumUnlocked rules.

diff --git a/src/Game/main.cpp b/src/Game/main.cpp
index bbc29d6..5eb9850 100644
--- a/src/Game/main.cpp
+++ b/src/Game/main.cpp
@@ -614,7 +614,11 @@ static void Initialize()
         OSYieldThread();
     }
 
+#endif
+#if !defined(MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_MAIN_BOOTSTRAP) || defined(MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_FRONTEND_DOMINATION)
     EnableAllStadiums();
+#endif
+#if !defined(MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_MAIN_BOOTSTRAP)
     const char* buildInfo =
         GetTweakString("/General/Build Info/BuildNumber", 0);
     if (buildInfo != 0)
